@ruhr_french
title: Put the fight against the French occupiers first.
subtitle: <span class="f-right">Right</span> divided, <span class="f-left">Left</span> against, <span class="f-minor">Minor currents</span> against. Wins some nationalist-minded workers; the Left and Zinoviev object.
