@zentrale_closed
title: The majority's list only: shut the Left out.
subtitle: <span class="f-right">Right</span> for, <span class="f-left">Left</span> against, <span class="f-minor">Minor currents</span> divided. The Right is calm, the Left furious; Moscow dislikes the split.
choose-if: mo_ok_closed = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Right will not table this: it goes against its core ideas.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.motionVote(Q, 'leipzig', 'zentrale', 'closed'); !}
go-to: zentrale_done

@zentrale_moderate
title: Make room for three moderate Leftists.
subtitle: <span class="f-right">Right</span> for, <span class="f-left">Left</span> divided, <span class="f-minor">Minor currents</span> for. The Left grumbles less.
choose-if: mo_ok_moderate = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Right will not table this: it goes against its core ideas.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.motionVote(Q, 'leipzig', 'zentrale', 'moderate'); !}
go-to: zentrale_done

@zentrale_leaders
title: Bring in the Left's leaders, Fischer and Maslow.
subtitle: <span class="f-right">Right</span> divided, <span class="f-left">Left</span> for, <span class="f-minor">Minor currents</span> for. The Left calms down and Moscow approves; your own faction grumbles.
choose-if: mo_ok_leaders = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Right will not table this: it goes against its core ideas.
on-arrival: {! window.RF.motionVote(Q, 'leipzig', 'zentrale', 'leaders'); !}
